{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you love the ocean?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Sea of Peridot and live your own ocean life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a self-sufficient life through aquaculture and fishing, or connect and cooperate with local villagers. Strike profitable deals through fierce haggling, travel between charming towns, and collect unforgettable memories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craving an escape from daily life?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail into uncharted waters! Encounter unexpected events, explore countless islands, and uncover hidden treasures. You might even meet a few special friends on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to make it your own?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your outfits, your island, and even the sea itself. Use what you\u2019ve gathered to craft something meaningful or simply splurge for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy your ocean life, your way.</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055430?t=1762266413","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3055430?t=1762266413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055430/f75cf44c75b7110a860f89b650168357f10a249a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762266413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055430/f75cf44c75b7110a860f89b650168357f10a249a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762266413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you love the ocean?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Sea of Peridot and live your own ocean life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a self-sufficient life through aquaculture and fishing, or connect and cooperate with local villagers. Strike profitable deals through fierce haggling, travel between charming towns, and collect unforgettable memories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craving an escape from daily life?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail into uncharted waters! Encounter unexpected events, explore countless islands, and uncover hidden treasures. You might even meet a few special friends on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to make it your own?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your outfits, your island, and even the sea itself. Use what you\u2019ve gathered to craft something meaningful or simply splurge for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy your ocean life, your way.</strong> </p>","developers":["Oldice Max"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055430/7db7e05d39e837c366d538164bcb18766b582e07/header.jpg?t=1762266413","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3055430/907088636/08e86e2a0a9035395b14778421fd6dcd8bb04ab7/1762264195/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762266411","dash_h264":"https://video.ak